rward to the signing of  ron perlman who won the golden globe for  his role in the tv series beauty and the  beast among others  the 71 year old actor with a striking  appearance will voice the character  optimus primal and this is not the first  time as pearlman was already responsible  for the dubbing of the maximal's leader  in the transformers franchise prime wars  trilogy in terms of content transformers  rise of the beasts is set in the 1990s  after the events of bumblebee  you will not only see the old familiar  decepticons in front of the camera but  above all  also the maximals who are capable of  transforming into mammals as well as  the predacons who are at least partial  descendants of the decepticons  last but not least the terracons who  some kind of re-animated machine  creatures  are a new addition we are excited about  further information on the upcoming  transformers rise of the beasts  and are looking forward to the expected  release date on june 24th  2022 after part 11  it's over this is just about everything  you need to know about the main series  of the fast and furious  franchise it has been known for some  time that the series will likely go into  outer space in the meantime  and it is also no secret that many would  like to see crossover with the jurassic  world franchise which is also set to end  soon  now fast and furious star tyres gibson  is taking things of another notch and is  hoping for a crossover with transformers  frankly this idea is only half as absurd  as vin diesel's who is probably about to  retire having a velociraptor stuck to  his grill in a 1970 dodge charger while  fleeing from two t-rex  so it does make sense that huge machines  meet fast sports cars while the action  aspect which has been emphasized since  fast and furious 5 at the latest  should not be lacking either with  decepticons and the likes  but let's not get ahead of ourselves  after all these are by  no means official plans so far they are  merely tyrus gibson's fantasies  even though this idea has been met with  a lot of positive feedback from the  community the ninth  fast and furious movie has been playing  in theaters since june 25th  what at first sounded like a weird rumor  might have actually been confirmed now  because  marvel is said to have changed one of  the two post-credit scenes of the disney  play series one division in the  aftermath  more specifically it concerns episode 9  in which wanda stays in a lonely forest  cabin to study the darkhold  at first glance some cosmetic change is  unnoticeable that is that the trees look  a bit paler and also that the light is  slightly altered  however what is now causing quite a stir  is a difficult to recognize outline in  the forest sliding down the hill  apparently this figure is meant to be dr  strange after all wanda is expected to  play a crucial role in the upcoming  doctor strange and the multiverse of  madness  but is that really the case we don't  believe so and reddit uses xenophobe  provides the most  plausible reason in a simple video it  seems that the light shining out of the  window of the cabin has been edited out  the problem is that they forgot to  remove the effect from the rest of the  scene as well  which is why it looks like a mysterious  figure is flying down the mountain  in other words it's a hoax still there  are two possibilities why the scene was  changed optically either it also appears  on doctor strange on the multiverse of  madness and was adjusted to avoid  continuity errors  or we're really just talking about a  clumsy mistake by the creators which can  be traced back to the stressful schedule  during the pandemic  nevertheless the whole thing generated  quite a bit of buzz although it was  debunked in the end  quentin tarantino is a man in great  demand who always seems to have work to  do  he is currently promoting his book once  upon a time in hollywood and chats about  other projects  along the way the joe rogan podcast also  discussed a possible kill bill 3 and it  looks like tarantino has a pretty clear  idea of what that film ought to look  like  the storyline would be set almost 20  years after that of kill bill 2  almost 2 decades after the bright and  her daughter bb finally found peace  bibi now an adult would be played by  none other than huma thurman's daughter  maya hawk who already started once upon  a time in hollywood with tarantino  thurman herself would then obviously  embody the bride again  and presumably be seen on screen  alongside l driver sofia fatale  and goku's twin sister shiaki as we all  know tarantino is going to make  one more movie which is why after all  these statements the question naturally  arises whether this could already be  teaser for kill bill 3. unfortunately  not it actually appears to be nothing  more than an innocent gimmick  after all tarantino has already revealed  that his last film will be more of a  small epilogue and not a full feature  film  thus patience is still required  after it was announced almost a month  ago that the new tomb raider movie will  get a new script as well as the new  title obsidian there are now new details  about alicia become the second  appearance as lara croft as reported by  the side geek vibes nation things  suggest central america as the setting  similar to the video game shadow of the  tomb raider from 2018.  initially supernatural events were also  planned for the film but that was still  when ben wheatley was intended to be  director  on the other hand the series is now  directed by misha green and  she obviously has some expertise in  horror thanks to her serious lovecraft  country  the setting will be primarily based on  the mauin area as evidenced not only by  first logline for the story but  also by various casting calls a precise  release date  for tomb raider obsidian has not been  set yet but we will keep you up to date  as  always  [Music]

